dirtransfert (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Cancel button (GUI) and cancellation token in send/receive engine.
  * Configurable request pipeline (--pipeline / GUI slider, 1-64, default 8).
  * Pre-generated pairing code on receive start.
  * Actionable Linux firewall message (ufw/firewall-cmd).
  * GUI footer reserved via bottom panel; docs updated (Releases, CHANGELOG).

