dirtransfert (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Security: direction byte in nonce to prevent cross-direction nonce reuse.
  * Chunked streaming transfer (1 MiB frames), no more full files in RAM.
  * Pipelined file requests, explicit OK/FAIL final status, I/O timeouts.
  * Removed hand-rolled SHA-256 in favor of the sha2 crate.
  * CI workflow (fmt, clippy, tests).

